  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adolescents, Youth and Peace in Maguindanao - UNICEF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project addresses some of the main drivers of conflict in Maguindanao and its successful implementation will make an important contribution to the overall Bangsamoro peace process in Mindanao. The objective is to support alternative learning services and to Increase the protection and life skills of adolescents and young people in the region.</narrative>
  </description>
